WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[No sound] The Amariya home page: "A front desk that never misses a call", with the voice orb and a Talk to Amariya button.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Scrolling down, the particle orb waits with a "Tap to talk" prompt.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
The scroll story begins: "1:04 am. Someone calls to book."

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
"Amariya answers on the first ring, in their language." Greetings in different languages leave the orb.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.000
"The booking lands in your system. Your team sleeps."

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
A strip of the businesses it is built for: dental practices, clinic groups, boutique hotels and resorts.
